    <fullName>Wire_Type__c</fullName>
    <description>Which wire on the deal this is: the earnest money wire from checklist group B, or the closing wire from group I. A deal has BOTH, each with its own independent verbal verification (B2 and I7), so without this column the two are indistinguishable on the same Transaction and the closing wire evidence can be read as the earnest money wire evidence. Restricted so a third spelling cannot be introduced by a data load. Blank on disposition wires, which have only one.</description>
    <inlineHelpText>Which wire this is on the deal. Earnest Money is the group B wire; Closing is the group I wire.</inlineHelpText>
